# AutoRefine — line-ending & binary hygiene (SPEC 98.2, v0.84).
# The A-pins and the byte-exact tests assume LF; mixed editors and a
# Windows checkout must not rewrite tracked text files.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary artifacts: never line-ending-normalized, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.mp4 binary
*.avi binary
*.mov binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.flac binary
*.npz binary
*.zip binary
